        {
          "text": "Yehoiakim rundi pare pier ario wi abic kinde m’emaku camu ker; man ecamu ker rundi apar wi acel i Yerusalem: e etimo gin ma rac i wang’ Yehova Mungu pare. ",
          "type": "text",
