        {
          "text": "Yehoiakin rundi pare abora kinde m’emaku camu ker; man ecamu ker dwi adek ku ceng’ apar i Yerusalem: man etimo gin ma rac i wang’ Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
