                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka rundi dwogo ubimo ma Nebukadnezar uoro kwenda, ugame utere Babeli, kud agulu ma ber mi ot pa Yehova, man eketho Zedekia m’umin mire ni ubimo wi Yuda ku Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
