                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zedekia rundi pare pier ario wi acel kinde m’emaku camu ker; man ecamu ker rundi apar wi acel i Yerusalem: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man etimo gin ma rac i wang’ Yehova Mungu pare; ejwigre gire ngo i wang’ Yeremia ma jabila m’uyero lembe ku dhu Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze 17:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ejai bende ni ubimo ma Nebukadnezar, m’uketho ekwong’o kwong’ ku Mungu: ento eciko ng’ute, man edwoko adundene nwang’ kum lokre ba Yehova, Mungu mir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mange ke judongo mi julam ceke, ku dhanu, gidubo dit apila tok ginmajudagu ceke mi thek; man gicido ot pa Yehova m’edwoko leng’ i Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova, Mungu pa kwaru migi, uoro kwenda pare i bang’gi, m’eai ko pir kugweno, eoro, kum ngisi nege kum dhanu pare, man kum kabedo pare: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento gicayu jukwenda pa Mungu, man gipiemo lembe pare, gitimo co de ni jubila pare, cil ma kwinyo pa Yehova wok ko kum dhanu pare, maram ma kabothne mbe.",
          "type": "text",
