          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie i rundi ma kwong’ane pa Kuro m’ubimo mir Ajemi, kara lembe pa Yehova ma ku dhu Yeremia utimbre kakare, Yehova ting’o tipo pa Kuro m’ubimo mir Ajemi, ketho nia etimo lembang’ola i ker pare mba mba, man ekethe i lembagora bende, m’uwacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
