              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.44.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 44:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuro m’ubimo mir Ajemi wacu kumae, Ker ceke m’i ng’om Yehova, Mungu m’i polo, mio ira; man eng’olo ira ya agom ire ot i Yerusalem, ma ni i Yuda. Ng’atu ma tek ni i kindwu mi dhanu pare ceke, Yehova Mungu pare bed kude, man wek eidh malu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.23"
            ]
